{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16556","headline":"经禁城 · 刘复","name":"经禁城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日没路且长，游子欲涕零。\n荒城无人路，秋草飞寒萤。\n东南古丘墟，莽苍驰郊垧。\n黄云晦断岸，枯井临崩亭。\n昔人竟何之，穷泉独冥冥。\n苍苔没碑版，朽骨无精灵。\n俛仰寄世间，忽如流波萍。\n金石非汝寿，浮生等臊腥。\n不如学神仙，服食求丹经。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}